[00:00.00] 作曲 : Andrea Rocha
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:00.24]Summer days, they're all so bright
[00:00.24]夏日晴空如此灿烂
[00:02.87]We laugh, looking at shapes up in the sky
[00:02.87]我们笑着仰望云卷云舒
[00:08.34]Oh-oh
[00:11.46]Yeah, I don't know if I remember right
[00:11.46]或许记忆已模糊
[00:14.51]But I swear you said that you'd never leave my side
[00:14.51]但我分明记得你发誓永不离开
[00:19.92]But you lied
[00:19.92]你却食言
[00:22.96]They say blood's thicker than water
[00:22.96]都说血浓于水
[00:26.16]But I'm closer to the ocean than to you
[00:26.16]可我离海洋比离你更近
[00:31.57]Oh, to you
[00:31.57]离你
[00:34.63]And I wish when I was younger
[00:34.63]多希望年少时
[00:37.89]I hadn't put all of my faith into you
[00:37.89]没把全部信仰寄托于你
[00:43.19]Oh, to you
[00:43.19]于你
[00:46.04]'Cause my first heartbreak looks a little bit like me
[00:46.04]因为我初次心碎的模样 竟与自己如此相像
[00:51.87]He's got my eyes and a freckle on his cheek
[00:51.87]他继承我的眼眸 脸颊雀斑
[00:57.76]And I can't hide it, it is bitter and it's sweet
[00:57.76]这无法掩饰的苦涩甜蜜
