[01:11.90]竟与自己如此相像
[01:16.01]And when you left, I learned to cry
[01:16.01]你离开时我学会哭泣
[01:18.87]But what hurt me most was my mother's eyes when she wept
[01:18.87]但母亲含泪的目光最刺痛我
[01:24.44]Oh no
[01:24.44]噢 不
