[02:02.11]'Cause my first heartbreak looks a little bit like me
[02:02.11]因为我初次心碎的模样 竟与自己如此相像
[02:07.99]He's got my eyes and a freckle on his cheek
[02:07.99]他继承我的眼眸 脸颊雀斑
[02:13.79]And I can't hide it, it's bitter and it's sweet
[02:13.79]这无法掩饰的苦涩甜蜜
[02:19.65]'Cause my first heartbreak looks a little bit like me
