[02:24.94]竟与自己如此相像
[02:49.12]My first heartbreak, he left me at thirteen
[02:49.12]十三岁那年被他抛弃
[02:56.25]But I have grown and fixed what's underneath
[02:56.25]如今我已修补好内心伤痕
